#: manual/about.md:3
msgid "This collection gathers the *Probably Stolen* mods written by KCN-judu. Every mod lives in its own repository, with its own releases and Steam Workshop page; the collection repository ties them together as Git submodules and builds this site from their documentation."
msgstr "这个合集收录 KCN-judu 为《深空当铺：可能是偷的》（*Probably Stolen*）制作的模组。每个模组都有自己的仓库、发布版本和 Steam 创意工坊页面；合集仓库以 Git 子模块把它们组织在一起，并用它们的文档生成本站。"

#: manual/about.md:5
#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:5
msgid "Principles"
msgstr "原则"

#: manual/about.md:7
msgid "A mod keeps the game's rules. It may remove waiting, guessing or wasted work, but customers accept what they accepted before, locks still lock and saves load as they did. Where a mod changes how something is computed, it computes the same answer."
msgstr "模组不改游戏规则。它可以去掉干等、瞎猜和白做的工作，但顾客接受的东西和以前一样，锁照样锁着，存档也和以前一样读取。模组改了某个东西的算法，算出来的结果不变。"

#: manual/about.md:8
msgid "A mod asks for no permission. It declares no capabilities, so the game enables it without a prompt. Reflection only names game types directly, which the game's mod scanner accepts."
msgstr "模组不要任何权限。它不声明任何能力，所以游戏启用它时不会弹出权限确认。反射只直接写出游戏的类型名，游戏的模组扫描器接受这种写法。"

#: manual/about.md:9
msgid "A patch that cannot attach, after a game update for example, turns its own feature off and writes one line to `Player.log`. The rest of the mod and the game keep running."
msgstr "补丁挂不上时（比如游戏更新之后），模组只关掉对应的功能，并在 `Player.log` 里写一行说明。模组的其余部分和游戏照常运行。"

#: manual/about.md:10
msgid "Performance work starts from the game's own log and from a profiler. The numbers behind each fix are in its documentation."
msgstr "性能优化从游戏自己的日志和性能分析器入手。每项修复背后的数据，都写在它的文档里。"

